(Executive Summary & Project Documentation) '
(Team: Tech Alchemist \(Code: KH095\)) '
(Project: FoundersHub \(Ideas are cheap. Delivery is the currency.\)) '
(Date: September 2026) '
() '
(FoundersHub is an execution-driven three-sided platform connecting:) '
(- Startup Founders: Form teams, run 14-day execution sprints across 8 departments.) '
(- Developers: Apply to departments, claim tasks, ship verified code, earn equity.) '
(- Investors: Discover high-execution startups, evaluate performance scores, syndicate capital.) '
ET
