(Frontend Architecture:) '
(- Framework: React 19 + Vite \(Single Page Application\)) '
(- Styling: Tailwind CSS, Glassmorphic UI with Dark Mode design system) '
(- Icons & Charts: Lucide React, Recharts analytics) '
(- Routing: React Router v7 with vercel.json SPA rewrites) '
() '
(Backend Architecture:) '
(- Server: Node.js with Express 5 REST API Gateway) '
(- Database: MongoDB Atlas using Mongoose ORM) '
(- Authentication: JWT token-based authentication with bcrypt hashing) '
(- AI Layer: Google Gemini API integration \(@google/genai\)) '
(- File Uploads: Multer with verified resume upload validation) '
ET
endstream
