(1. 3-Point Readiness Gate: Validates startup concepts before publishing.) '
(2. Department-Based Sprints: 8 modular departments \(Engineering, Product, Growth, etc.\).) '
(3. Dynamic Equity Allocation: Contribution points dynamically calculate equity pie.) '
(4. Developer Portfolio & Profile: Verified builder score and task milestones.) '
(5. Financial Ledger & Runway: Burn rate, runway calculation, transaction audit log.) '
(6. Investor Matching & Syndicate: Deterministic scoring algorithm with 1% platform fee.) '
(7. AI Founder Copilot & Mentor: Real-time department scoped guidance.) '
